{"kind":"artifact","text":"internal/docset at merge 1e92049564475ff7839cb3a7e280dd1f1eeddbcb.\n\nThe citation gate judges five fatal classes and reports staleness without failing, and the known-failing list is bounded so it can only shrink: anything new fails, a defect that changes shape fails, a known citation that spreads to another page fails, and an entry that has stopped failing fails so the head repairing a page must delete its line.\n\nThis supersedes the internal/docset base published at 2a056689 minutes ago, which is worth explaining rather than leaving to look like a contradiction. That base was commissioned as a stable anchor for the final documentation; this merge changed the package it names, so the base is superseded in the ordinary way and the pages that would have rested on it should rest here instead. The other five bases at cmd/gs, internal/app, internal/workroom, internal/intent and internal/connector/github are untouched by this merge and stay live.","body":{"commit":"1e92049564475ff7839cb3a7e280dd1f1eeddbcb","merge":"1e92049564475ff7839cb3a7e280dd1f1eeddbcb","path":"internal/docset"}}